---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Compliance — ADA/WCAG Monitoring & Audit Services | CC3PO">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center text-center px-4 sm:px-6 pt-24 pb-16 overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a12]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(16,185,129,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(16,185,129,0.04) 0%, transparent 50%);"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 tracking-wide mb-6">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        3,117 ADA Lawsuits Filed in 2025
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tighter text-white mb-5">
        Don't Get Sued.<br>
        <span class="text-emerald-400">Get Compliant.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
        ADA/WCAG compliance isn't optional — it's the law. One lawsuit can cost <strong class="text-white">$4,000+</strong> per violation. We scan, fix, and monitor your website so you never have to worry.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/products/scan/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25">Free Compliance Scan</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/10 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-200">View Plans</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Threat Stats -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <div class="text-center p-6 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 leading-none mb-1">3,117</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500">ADA lawsuits in 2025</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-6 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-red-400 leading-none mb-1">$4K+</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500">Per violation penalty</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-6 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 leading-none mb-1">96%</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500">Of sites are non-compliant</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-6 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 leading-none mb-1">26%</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500">Of sued sites had widgets</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What Is ADA/WCAG Compliance -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white text-center mb-4 tracking-tight">What Is ADA/WCAG Compliance?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 text-sm sm:text-base">The Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) requires websites to be accessible. WCAG 2.2 is the standard. Non-compliance means legal exposure — not just bad UX.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">ADA Title III</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Requires "places of public accommodation" — including websites — to be accessible. Courts have ruled: <strong class="text-gray-400">your website is a place of public accommodation.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">WCAG 2.2 AA</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">The Web Content Accessibility Guidelines are the technical standard. Level AA is the legal benchmark. It covers <strong class="text-gray-400">color contrast, alt text, keyboard nav, screen readers,</strong> and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">The Risk Is Real</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Serial plaintiffs file <strong class="text-gray-400">hundreds of demand letters per week.</strong> Small businesses — HVAC, plumbing, dental, restaurants — are the #1 target. $4K per violation adds up fast.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Common Violations -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white text-center mb-4 tracking-tight">Top 5 Violations That Get You Sued</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12 text-sm sm:text-base">These are the exact issues plaintiffs scan for. If your site has any of these, you're exposed.</p>
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm">1</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Missing Alt Text on Images</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Screen readers can't describe images without alt text. This is the #1 lawsuit trigger and the easiest to fix.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm">2</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Poor Color Contrast</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Text that's hard to read against its background fails WCAG 2.1 AA (4.5:1 ratio for normal text, 3:1 for large text).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm">3</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">No Keyboard Navigation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">If users can't navigate your site with just a keyboard (Tab, Enter, Escape), it's a violation. Every interactive element must be reachable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm">4</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Missing Form Labels</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Every form field needs an associated label. Placeholder text alone doesn't count — screen readers skip it entirely.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm">5</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">No Accessibility Policy Page</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Missing accessibility statement, privacy policy, or terms of service pages. 100% of audited sites were missing at least one required page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Widget Warning -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 bg-red-500/5 border border-red-500/20 rounded-2xl p-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Accessibility Widgets Don't Protect You</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <strong class="text-red-400">26% of sued websites had accessibility overlays/widgets installed.</strong> Overlay tools like AccessiBe, UserWay, and AudioEye do not make your site compliant. Courts have ruled they don't satisfy ADA requirements, and some plaintiffs specifically target sites using them.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            Real compliance requires fixing the underlying code — proper HTML, ARIA attributes, color contrast, and keyboard navigation. That's what we do.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How We Fix It -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white text-center mb-4 tracking-tight">How We Fix It</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center max-w-lg mx-auto mb-12 text-sm sm:text-base">Three steps from non-compliant to protected.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="relative p-8 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 text-center rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto mb-2 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-mono">STEP 1</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Free Scan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We scan your entire site for ADA/WCAG violations. Get a detailed report in minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative p-8 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 text-center rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto mb-2 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.066 2.573c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573 1.066c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066-2.573c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-mono">STEP 2</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">We Fix Everything</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Our team implements all compliance fixes — alt text, contrast, ARIA, keyboard nav, policy pages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative p-8 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 text-center rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/25 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto mb-2 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-2 font-mono">STEP 3</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Stay Protected</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Ongoing daily scans catch new issues before they become lawsuits. You stay compliant automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing -->
    <div id="pricing" class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white text-center mb-4 tracking-tight">Compliance Plans</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12 text-sm sm:text-base">Choose your level of protection. Every plan includes a free scan.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Compliance Pack -->
        <div class="flex flex-col p-8 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Compliance Pack</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">One-time audit & fix</p>
          <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-0.5">$199<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal"> one-time</span></div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">No recurring fees</p>
          <ul class="flex-1 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Full ADA/WCAG 2.2 AA audit</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Detailed fix recommendations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Fix implementation by our team</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Compliance report for your records</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>30-day follow-up support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/5kQ8wO47Q3EXfpW4y01B61u" class="block text-center w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25">Get Compliant</a>
        </div>
        <!-- Shield (Popular) -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-500/5 border-2 border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-emerald-500 text-white text-[11px] font-bold px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full">POPULAR</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Compliance Shield</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Ongoing monitoring</p>
          <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-0.5">$97<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">Cancel anytime</p>
          <ul class="flex-1 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Everything in Compliance Pack</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><strong class="text-white">Daily compliance scans</strong></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Instant alerts when issues found</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Fix guidance for every issue</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Compliance Shield badge</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Monthly compliance report</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/14o5fCgU0g4YelOscQ1B61w" class="block text-center w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25">Start Shield</a>
        </div>
